<h1>Bogo Sort</h1>
<p>
    Bogo Sort starts by checking if the array is sorted.
    If it is not, then it shuffles the entire array, then checks again.
    It repeats this process until the entire array is sorted.
    <br>
    <br>
    Needless to say, Bogo Sort performs terribly. 
    Because it uses probability to sort the array it is possible that the array will never be sorted,
    giving Bogo Sort a worst case of infinity.
    <br>
    <br>
    Bogo Sort is not used in the real world to sort data.
</p>

